<title>USA: Granite State declares 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Granite State declares 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>KEENE, N.H. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite State Bankshares Inc said Monday that it has declared a three-for-two stock split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock split is payable May 9 to stockholders of record April 25.</p>
</text>
